{"id":"a6ab1076181efd97","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-pcp-gap-hardness.md","title":"Constant-Gap Hardness of MAX-3SAT","display":"thm-pcp-gap-hardness — Constant-Gap Hardness of MAX-3SAT","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-pcp-gap-hardness","aliases":["28-thm-pcp-gap-hardness","PCP Gap Hardness for MAX-3SAT"],"display":"thm-pcp-gap-hardness — Constant-Gap Hardness of MAX-3SAT","depends_on":["[[28-thm-pcp]]","[[28-df-max-3sat]]","[[28-df-gap-problem]]","[[28-df-np]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 11.9 and §11.3.1","source_printed_pages":"243–246","source_pdf_pages":"269–272","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-pcp-gap-hardness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-pcp-gap-hardness</span><span>PCP Gap Hardness for MAX-3SAT</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pcp-gap-hardness — Constant-Gap Hardness of MAX-3SAT"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9e7559e5bc3868e1\" href=\"?note=9e7559e5bc3868e1\" title=\"28-thm-pcp\">28-thm-pcp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d6ed84d59965705b\" href=\"?note=d6ed84d59965705b\" title=\"28-df-max-3sat\">28-df-max-3sat</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"79a758be0d442e63\" href=\"?note=79a758be0d442e63\" title=\"28-df-gap-problem\">28-df-gap-problem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 11.9 and §11.3.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"243–246"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"269–272"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_3\">\\(\\mathcal F_3\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_3\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_3\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}\">\\(\\operatorname{val}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d6ed84d59965705b\" href=\"?note=d6ed84d59965705b\" title=\"28-df-max-3sat\">28-df-max-3sat</a>；语言到承诺问题的归约见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"79a758be0d442e63\" href=\"?note=79a758be0d442e63\" title=\"28-df-gap-problem\">28-df-gap-problem</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}\">\\(\\mathbf{NP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\\in(0,1)\">\\(\\varepsilon\\in(0,1)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Gap3SAT}_\\varepsilon\\coloneqq(\\{\\operatorname{enc}_3(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\mathcal F_3,\\ \\operatorname{val}(\\varphi)=1\\},\\{\\operatorname{enc}_3(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\mathcal F_3,\\ \\operatorname{val}(\\varphi)\\le1-\\varepsilon\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Gap3SAT}_\\varepsilon\\coloneqq(\\{\\operatorname{enc}_3(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\mathcal F_3,\\ \\operatorname{val}(\\varphi)=1\\},\\{\\operatorname{enc}_3(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\mathcal F_3,\\ \\operatorname{val}(\\varphi)\\le1-\\varepsilon\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\varepsilon\\in(0,1)\\ \\forall L\\in\\mathbf{NP}\\ L\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\operatorname{Gap3SAT}_\\varepsilon.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\varepsilon\\in(0,1)\\ \\forall L\\in\\mathbf{NP}\\ L\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\operatorname{Gap3SAT}_\\varepsilon.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>用显式承诺归约替换把有序问题对当作语言放入 NPHard 的类型错误。非适应、完备性一的 PCP 转成常数元约束，随后逐约束 3CNF 化，保留一个固定正的间隙；源码 Theorem 11.14 的严格阈值可缩小间隙改写为此非严格阈值。已读 §11.3 转换论证；未独立复核第22章完整PCP构造。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Theorem 11.9 and §11.3.1，印刷页 243–246；PDF 页 269–272。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>R6证据边界：常数间隙转换依赖未完整核验的PCP定理。本条可作为有明确来源限制的陈述记录，当前不作为已完成证明核验的依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-thm-pcp","status":"resolved","id":"9e7559e5bc3868e1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-thm-pcp]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-max-3sat","status":"resolved","id":"d6ed84d59965705b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-max-3sat]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-gap-problem","status":"resolved","id":"79a758be0d442e63","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-gap-problem]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-max-3sat","status":"resolved","id":"d6ed84d59965705b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F_3$、$\\operatorname{enc}_3$、$\\operatorname{val}$ 见 [[28-df-max-3sat]]；语言到承诺问题的归约见 [[28-df-gap-problem]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-gap-problem","status":"resolved","id":"79a758be0d442e63","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F_3$、$\\operatorname{enc}_3$、$\\operatorname{val}$ 见 [[28-df-max-3sat]]；语言到承诺问题的归约见 [[28-df-gap-problem]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{NP}$ 见 [[28-df-np]]；$\\varepsilon\\in(0,1)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F_3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon\\in(0,1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Gap3SAT}_\\varepsilon\\coloneqq(\\{\\operatorname{enc}_3(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\mathcal F_3,\\ \\operatorname{val}(\\varphi)=1\\},\\{\\operatorname{enc}_3(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\mathcal F_3,\\ \\operatorname{val}(\\varphi)\\le1-\\varepsilon\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists\\varepsilon\\in(0,1)\\ \\forall L\\in\\mathbf{NP}\\ L\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\operatorname{Gap3SAT}_\\varepsilon.","display":true}],"bytes":2044,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-142","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"PCP：[[28-df-pcp]]、[[28-thm-pcp]]、[[28-df-gap-problem]]、[[28-df-max-3sat]]、[[28-thm-pcp-gap-hardness]]。"}],"outgoing":["9e7559e5bc3868e1","d6ed84d59965705b","79a758be0d442e63","0cb5248561455df8"]}